         "widgets_values":[
            "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is a cute chibi girl with an oversized head, expressive anime eyes, small hands, soft rounded features, and a compact childlike cartoon design. She is visibly pouting: puffed cheeks, knitted eyebrows, narrowed eyes, and a small unhappy pout. Her design is wholesome, playful, and non-sexual.\n\n<Audio 1> is the sole reference for the spoken performance and timing. It says, \"Hey, you promised to take me shopping.\" Use the referenced recording verbatim as the output speech: preserve the exact words, language, pronunciation, voice, timing, and youthful impatient tone. Do not paraphrase, translate, re-synthesize, shorten, extend, or replace the recording. Do not invent additional dialogue.\n\nsummary:\n[audio-driven character performance] Create a short single-shot chibi animation driven by <Audio 1>. The chibi girl is waiting to go shopping and is adorably annoyed that the promise has not been kept. The audio reference controls the timing of her facial expressions, gestures, and lip movement. There is no image or video reference to reproduce.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (entire shot): fully_preserved - the chibi proportions, rounded face, expressive anime eyes, puffed cheeks, knitted brows, and pout remain clear and consistent.\n\n<Audio 1> (entire shot): fully_preserved - the original recording is copied verbatim, including the exact spoken sentence, speech rhythm, voice, pronunciation, and emotional emphasis. The mouth movement and gestures should align naturally with the words.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] A single continuous medium close-up of the chibi girl in a bright, cozy room near the front door, framed from the waist up. She faces the camera and looks directly at the viewer as if addressing the person who promised to take her shopping. A small shopping tote and a pair of colorful shoes sit near the door in the background, making the situation immediately readable without adding another character.\n\nAt the opening, she stands with her arms folded, cheeks puffed, lips pushed into an exaggerated pout, and eyebrows lowered in cute frustration. As she begins speaking, she leans toward the camera and points one tiny finger toward the door, then taps her foot impatiently. Her expression softens for a beat when she says \"promised,\" but she quickly returns to the pout and raises both eyebrows in an unmistakable \"well?\" expression.\n\nOn the final words, she uncrosses her arms, gestures toward the shopping tote, and gives a small pleading tug on the viewer's sleeve or an inviting beckoning motion. End on her puffed-cheek pout and an expectant stare, holding for a brief beat after the line finishes. Keep the animation charming, readable, and synchronized to the audio.\n\nvisual_style:\nClean colorful 2D chibi anime animation, soft rounded shapes, warm indoor lighting, simple background details, gentle squash-and-stretch, expressive eyes and mouth, polished but playful motion, and a wholesome comedic tone. No realistic anatomy, no photorealism, no dramatic action, no text, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nUse the original <Audio 1> recording verbatim as the only audible dialogue and preserve it in the final video. Do not synthesize a new voice, change the words, translate the line, or add any other speech. Keep the room quiet with a very soft cloth rustle and tiny foot tap under the voice. Do not add competing speech or environmental noise.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNo music. Let the timing, intonation, and comedic pause in <Audio 1> carry the scene.\n\r\n"
